{"ID":"20240513083050-nglyz8g","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083050-nglyz8g","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083050-nglyz8g\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513164941-zsrk03t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513164941-zsrk03t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513164941-zsrk03t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:398,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:398\u0026#125;","title":"256","type":"doc","updated":"20240514163726"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513164941-zsrk03t","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 814px;","id":"20240513164941-zsrk03t","updated":"20240514163726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"200-4 L, J"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"16,瘦"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"04/22/2008"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 週末吃藥之後有些變數，腳會在晚上燒痛得醒來，所以老師要她今日回診。目前還剩下兩包藥。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早上通常吃牛奶(冰冷飲)加麥片，手足早上冷，但平時熱，手及腋下有汗。手足紅好多了，熱較嚴重。當熱來時，有燒熱感，大便每日，仍無汗(身體)。本週末有吃冰，朋友請客。不畏風。睡時身溫。無口渴。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右脈較不規則，左脈弦細數，脈數有力且浮。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不太伸出、紅乾，邊緣深紅。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"表仍不開，陽實。("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病患喝了含生附的藥方之後，身體會發熱，但是就是沒有流汗。此為陽實，要靠麻黃來發汗。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"從 4/16 藥方所剩下的兩包藥中，取出生附子。然後加入:麻黃三錢 杏仁三錢  (兩包) ("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黃與杏仁要等量"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(1) 原本藥吃得很合適，但經過週末之後，卻有變數。可能有其他因素所造成。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(2) 師曰: 此病患原本吃生附後，腋下會流汗，但因身體仍無汗，所以換成麻黃。若有皮膚病，原不用發表之藥。但以此病患的情況，必須要發表，汗出即好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}